ed help, and Queen Helena maneuvers for power.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7nh2e1VwfISacty6abHMBLz1Ski.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-15\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Welcome Is Fashion and Ceremony\",\"overview\":\"In Prince Liam's quest for vengeance, a secret is revealed that affects the monarchy's future while Princess Eleanor rekindles an old flame.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5uDRKrCBsE1Va1rYZucM1NriMSZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-22\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Is Not This Something More than Fantasy?\",\"overview\":\"Prince Liam and Princess Eleanor both take trips that don't end as they expected, while at home Queen Helena meets a new rival and King Cyrus receives some bad news.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/idwWn411wnb5lBFCyL8mdSaqVCa.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-11-29\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"What, Has This Thing Appear'd Again Tonight?\",\"overview\":\"King Cyrus draws a line in the sand with Queen Helena and Prince Liam as he does whatever he can to eliminate King Simon's legacy. Princess Eleanor makes a friend as a new wrinkle in the King's murder is potentially revealed.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o6q9IVSSKdr7WjC00L4rh2J44Uj.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-06\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Spirit That I Have Seen\",\"overview\":\"Princess Eleanor's new relationship makes waves in and outside of the palace as King Cyrus uses a public ceremony to solidify his image and Queen Helena learns of betrayal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i7VMxthjkMlxOyhDiS71igNhblf.jpg\",\"rating\":3,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-13\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Doubt Truth to Be a Liar\",\"overview\":\"The twins have a birthday party in the palace and things get out of hand. Queen Helena and Prince Liam look to the past for answers about the future.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nbGqVT8pIEQe3IjKQDJszMc3JnY.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-20\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Taint Not Thy Mind, nor Let Thy Soul Contrive Against Thy Mother\",\"overview\":\"Queen Helena and Princess Eleanor share some unexpected bonding time as Prince Liam investigates Domino.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mu4dGakgpLMQQIVMSend2xZD1Ge.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-27\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Be All My Sins Remembered\",\"overview\":\"Relationships are forever changed when The Royals' family history is called in to question.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2c3c9941FkumMQ3hcTC20YUlx4A.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-03\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"And Then It Started Like a Guilty Thing\",\"overview\":\"Uncertainty abounds as questions of the King's killer come to the forefront and the monarchy's structure is challenged.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8gl6LhbmyTmWIZ9Ci07vml5J9vH.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-10\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Serpent That Did Sting Thy Father's Life\",\"overview\":\"The royal family faces the possibility of the abolition of the monarchy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sHO2sIqED1YICrbHiIvvJ45lOI.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2016-01-17\",\"runtime\":44}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-03-15\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}